      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To maintain pallet stability in high-density racking, prioritize a low and centered center of gravity by stacking heavier items near the base. Ensure your loads are evenly distributed across all pallets to prevent uneven weight shifting. While interlocking isn't always feasible, using load bars or wrap-banding can significantly help secure individual pallets before stacking them high.",
